          <h3>The Restaurant Roulette Wheel</h3>
          <p>
            Add every restaurant you both enjoy, plus two or three you have
            been meaning to try. Spin on Saturday afternoon so there is time to
            book. A good habit: whoever argued against the result says
            afterward whether the food was actually good.
          </p>
          <div class="wheel-entries">
            <strong>Example entries</strong>
            <ul class="entry-tags">
              <li>The sushi place</li>
              <li>Corner Italian</li>
              <li>Taco spot</li>
              <li>New ramen bar</li>
              <li>Greek mezze</li>
              <li>The curry house</li>
              <li>Steakhouse splurge</li>
            </ul>
