            Spin for the type of food, then race each other to find the
            best-rated local option in that category. It turns choosing dinner
            into a small game. Add one cuisine neither of you has tried to keep
            it interesting.
          </p>
          <div class="wheel-entries">
            <strong>Example entries</strong>
            <ul class="entry-tags">
