            Skip the restaurant and let the wheel pick what you cook. Shop for
            it together, put music on and treat a weeknight like an event. Add
            a sentimental entry such as "recreate a meal from our last trip."
          </p>
          <div class="wheel-entries">
            <strong>Example entries</strong>
            <ul class="entry-tags">
              <li>Homemade ramen</li>
              <li>Pasta from scratch</li>
